    "body": "Not started: Codex (skull) · 2026-11-19. No claim was made.\n\nThis issue depends on #2584. #2584 is open and has no PR.\n\n- `upstream/main` `475373093` has no `machine_model` module in `camcraft-sim`.\n- No branch `issue/2584-*` is on `origin` or on `upstream`. The held patch of #2584 is not committed (see the stop comment on #2584).\n- #2583 is merged (`248b3ac45`). `MachineTree` is on main.\n\nThe work of this issue needs the body types and the \"generated\" mark of #2584:\n\n- the model builds the stated body in place of the generated one;\n- a body from a file is not marked \"generated\";\n- the machine-part check reports \"not judged\" for a missing STEP file.\n\nThere is no parent branch to stack on. A reader for the `body` key alone cannot meet \"Done means\", and it would fix the body types before #2584 does.\n\nSuggestion: work #2584 first. Then work this issue on main, or stack it on the PR of #2584. The label `blocked` on this issue would keep it out of the pick list until then; the coordinator decides.\n",
