    "body": "STOPPED before claim: Codex (uma).\n\nUpstream main f41aafff4013b79a92b508072c65dd3658a34382 has no machine_model module. #2584 remains open. It has no open PR to stack on. Its last comment says the patch is uncommitted and was not pushed.\n\n#2591 needs that model to replace generated bodies, record body provenance, and report a missing STEP body as not judged. Implementing the dependency here would also work #2584, outside this one-issue assignment.\n\nThe overlap checks found #2554 in machine/parse.rs, machine/validate.rs, and assets/machines/AGENTS.md, and #2763 in sim/src/lib.rs. Neither supplies the missing machine_model module. No claim, worktree, code change, test, or gate was made. Work can resume when #2584 lands or has an eligible PR to stack on.\n",
